<!--
  a4kStreaming settings (tvOS-like, read from 3 m). The same rules as a4k-home.xml: 1080p pixels, no includes and no
  named colours, Estuary font names, every control places itself (left/top).

  The add-on's page (bg_home, a little of the window behind showing through), a rail of categories on the left, and the
  current category's rows on a raised glass panel (sheet.png) on the right, both lists filled from Python
  (a4kStreaming/ui/settings.py). Up/Down on the rail switches the pane at once; Right or OK enters it. Python owns
  Left/Right in the pane (it steps an option or a number, or goes back to the rail) and steps Up/Down over the group
  headers, so the pane's edges say noop; Up and Down stop at the ends. The selected item of a list that has no focus
  keeps its focusedlayout, so the raised look shows only while the list has focus; the rail's current category keeps a
  faint fill.

  Rows: label left, value right as a chip. a4k.tone: on (accent fill, dark text), off (outline, light text), value
  (neutral fill; white with dark text on the focused row), warn (red fill), empty (plain text: an arrow, or "Sign in to
  IMDb first"). a4k.chip: s (On / Off / Set) or l (options, numbers, names). The focused row is a lighter surface with
  a white outline, lifted 1.02. a4k.step (Left/Right change the value: ‹ › inside the chip), a4k.off (needs the IMDb
  sign-in: dimmed), a4k.header (a group header: accent capitals, the row's top left blank as the gap between groups),
  a4k.grabbed (the Home order row being moved: accent outline, shadow), a4k.help (the line under the pane).
  No defaultcontrol: the lists are empty when the window inits; onInit fills them and then focuses one.
-->
